      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Article 1\n\nIn Article 2(1) of Directive 2014/65/EU, the following point is added:\n\n| ‘(p) | crowdfunding service providers as defined in point (e) of Article 2(1) of Regulation (EU) 2020/1503 of the European Parliament and of the Council(*1). |\n| --- | --- |",
      "text_sha256": "95b95e670fa7e0c814ad17c54d1f4e3a8584bafda7620c06ad9a687df4560b1e",
